UID:65ijacpi68s32b9m6dij4b9k6cqm2bb26kpj4b9hc8o3ce1lcdhm4opo70@google.com
CREATED:20260613T060056Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Dear Licensed Workforce\,</p><p>Hope you are well.</p><p>We 
 are delighted to announce that World Rugby’s webinar series on Women’s Heal
 th in rugby returns this month with a session on supporting girls in rugby 
 – and keeping them in the game.</p><ul><li><p>When: Tuesday 23rd June\, 12.
 00 UK time</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>What: Get practical tools\, insights and
  useful resources on how to support girls in rugby. Further information ava
 ilable here: <a href="https://www.world.rugby/media-zone/advisory/1044689?u
 tm_source=wr-media-zone&amp\;utm_medium=email&amp\;utm_campaign=world-rugby
 " target="_blank"><strong>World Rugby Women’s Health Webinar Series returns
  with session on supporting girls into rugby</strong></a></p></li></ul><ul>
 <li><p>Who: aimed at coaches\, parents or anyone involved in supporting gir
 ls in rugby</p></li></ul><p>You can sign-up by following this link: <a href
 ="https://worldrugby.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_Jz7yHw3vS2a0s-rFKUtzSA#/" 
 target="_blank"><strong>https://worldrugby.zoom.us/<wbr />webinar/register/
 WN_<wbr />Jz7yHw3vS2a0s-rFKUtzSA#/</strong></a></p><p>Please feel free to p
 ass on to anyone you think would be interested. You can also repost the onl
 ine assets on your channels with the registration link.</p><p>Thanks\,</p><
 p>Fraser Gow</p><p>Training and Education Coordinator</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T154538Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:World Rugby Women's Health Webinar Series
TRANSP:OPAQUE
ATTACH;FILENAME=Women's Health Webinar Series_16x9.pdf;FMTTYPE=application/
 pdf:https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pNHaBwbxdvN_UVdXQewLRkFdjrLG4hgb/view?
 usp=drivesdk
