 ucator(s): \nWerner Cromm\n\nPeer Mentors:\nGordon Hewitt\nTBC\n\nLocal Hos
 t: \nRugby Club Bonn-Rhein-Sieg e.V. (thomas.schmidt@rcbrs.de)\n\nIntroduct
