UID:68p6cp1m74s6ab9n64o66b9k69i6abb270pjeb9h70s34p9mc8oj2cb5ck@google.com
CREATED:20260211T125512Z
DESCRIPTION:Invititation – Dragons Junior Cup 2026\nWe are delighted to inv
 ite you to the very first Dragons Junior Cup!\nAfter settling well into our
  new home\, we would now like to officially \ninaugurate it with a U14 tour
 nament for the “older” youth teams as well.\nAt the moment\, we are plannin
 g to play the group stage on Saturday and the \nplacement matches on Sunday
 . Exact match times will be announced after \nthe registration deadline. Ho
 wever\, the tournament on Sunday is guaranteed \nto finish early enough to 
 allow teams with longer journeys to return home comfortably.\nIf fewer team
 s register than planned\, the tournament will be limited to May 2nd only.\n
 Our RCW bar\, including a barbecue\, will be open all day and will offer ev
 erything \nyou could wish for. A lunch menu for the teams will also be avai
 lable \n(price per player to be announced). Further details will follow aft
 er \nthe registration deadline.\nThe registration fee is €100 per team. The
  registration deadline is March 31\, 2026.\nYour team is considered registe
 red once the registration fee has been received.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T053952Z
LOCATION:Gaustraße 210\, 67549 Worms\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:U12-U14 Dragons Junior Cup at Rugby Club Worms
